---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
---
<Platform title="Promote your project" description="Follow the steps to request a reviewed promotional feature on Digivated and @digivatedx.">
<header class="page-intro promo-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Digivated promotion</p><h1>Put your project in front of curious people.</h1><p class="lede">Request a promotional feature on the Digivated site and @digivatedx. Purchase your spot on Gumroad, then send your project for review.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://digivated.gumroad.com/l/digivated-promo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View promo offer on Gumroad <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button" href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">Already purchased? Submit your project</a></div><p class="quiet">Paid promotion · Review required · Current price and purchase terms are shown on Gumroad.</p></header>
<section class="promo-steps" aria-labelledby="promo-steps-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">From purchase to review</p><h2 id="promo-steps-title">Three clear steps.</h2></div><ol><li><div><h3>Purchase your promo spot</h3><p>Read the offer and complete checkout on Gumroad. Keep your receipt—you’ll need it to help us match your purchase.</p><a href="https://digivated.gumroad.com/l/digivated-promo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the Gumroad offer ↗</a></div></li><li><div><h3>Send your project details</h3><p>Return here and choose “Paid promotion” on the submission form. Use your checkout email and include the order reference from your receipt, a working project link, and a clear description. Add an image and social handle if you have them.</p><a href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">Submit after purchasing →</a></div></li><li><div><h3>Wait for review</h3><p>We check your purchase and review your project for completeness and fit. We may email you for clarification. If approved, your project will be prepared for promotion on the site and @digivatedx.</p></div></li></ol></section>
<section class="promo-details" aria-label="Before you purchase"><div><h2>Know what to expect.</h2><p>A purchase starts the promotion process. It does not instantly publish your project or guarantee views, likes, followers, clicks, or sales.</p><p>Keep your receipt and follow the instructions in your Gumroad purchase. For purchase questions, reply to that receipt to contact the seller.</p></div><div><h2>Looking for a regular listing?</h2><p>You can also submit a project for ordinary directory review for free. Paid promotion is a separate request and requires the Gumroad purchase.</p><a class="button" href="/submit-project#project-form">Submit for free review</a></div></section>
<section class="promo-ready"><div><h2>Have your receipt ready?</h2><p>Send everything in one submission so we can review it together.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">Continue to submission →</a></section>
</Platform>

